research/audit/wave7-topology-uniform.proof-contracts.json:1145:          "claim": "Given $\\varepsilon>0$, choose $n$ with $2^{-n}<\\varepsilon$ by [L4]. Then $E_n\\subseteq\\{p\\le2^{-n}\\}\\subseteq\\{p<\\varepsilon\\}$, so the latter set is an entourage by upward closure. By [[def-gauge-of-pseudometrics]], $p$ is uniformly continuous for the original uniformity. [A2, step 2.2, L4, discharge-construct] ∎",
