research/audit/wave7-topology-uniform.proof-contracts.json-4051-          "source_section": "Statement",
research/audit/wave7-topology-uniform.proof-contracts.json-4052-          "quote": "In ZF, every countably based uniformity has a decreasing symmetric base $(E_n)$ with $E_{n+1}^{\\circ3}\\subseteq E_n$.",
