research/audit/wave7-proof-contracts.json-32391-          "source_section": "Statement",
research/audit/wave7-proof-contracts.json-32392-          "quote": "Assuming dependent choice, every entourage uniformity is generated by a gauge of uniformly continuous pseudometrics.",
